description=v3.7.1 one speed for everything: the exit now reverts the deep phase side by side too and the apply runs the same way, so the door, the tile and the installer all revert at the installer's pace. The tile is "Super Battery Saver" - a proper system-style battery icon that colours with the state, work detached from the tile so it can never hang, a press during a transition waits. And this mode's recents has a button in the app, on any launcher. RMX3430.
